{"src":"en","tgt":"tr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"tr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8184.65273,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8862.07051,"text":"Ancak Shenzhen bölgesi bu bakımdan biraz tek bir ülke gibi çalışıyor."},{"kind":"audio","t":8949.916342999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8955.895471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8961.047682999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8961.552644,"samples":7300,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":15116.013007000001,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15994.209963999998,"text":"Mekke'nin kuzeyindeki dağlardan birinin zirvesinde yer alan mağara, yakından"},{"kind":"audio","t":16082.553167999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16087.309626999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16092.587696999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16093.124867999999,"samples":8136,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":17742.108504,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18296.0801,"text":"dünyanın geri kalanından izole edilmiştir."},{"kind":"audio","t":18354.490414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18359.390489999998,"samples":32433,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"input","t":26569.763372,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27496.075329,"text":"İnsanlar artık bir kalemtraşa yaklaşmak zorunda kalmadan bilgisayar ekranlarına mesajlar yazıyorlar."},{"kind":"audio","t":27623.435617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27628.267515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27633.599924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27638.856015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27641.48024,"samples":18278,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":37543.668317,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39287.494287,"text":"Yüksek vergilendirmeli ülkelere giden gezginler, özellikle alkollü içecekler ve tütün gibi ürünlerde bazen hatırı sayılır miktarda para tasarrufu sağlayabilirler."},{"kind":"audio","t":39464.191384000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39468.660978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39473.772461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39479.036311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39484.311141000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39489.495073000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39494.104154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39495.118147,"samples":14990,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":45788.322584,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46546.498388,"text":"Bitkiler, fotosentez yoluyla güneşten kendi besinlerini üretirler. Ayrıca gölge de sağlarlar."},{"kind":"audio","t":46659.271946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46664.28834000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46669.478631000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46669.832515,"samples":2006,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"audio","t":46674.983448000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46676.794217,"samples":14043,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":58076.873406000006,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59312.529030000005,"text":"Hastane, diğer kişilerin olası enfeksiyonunu önlemek için hastanın diğerlerinden ayrılması da dahil olmak üzere, enfeksiyon kontrol protokolünü uygulamıştır."},{"kind":"audio","t":59480.23655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59485.107437000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59490.412257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59495.617098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59500.80502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59506.035871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59509.740447000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59510.052562000004,"samples":4123,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68726.374803,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69785.499866,"text":"Yapılan çalışma çoğunlukla teorikti, ancak program Yay galaksisinde yapılan gözlemleri simüle etmek için yazıldı."},{"kind":"audio","t":69909.640429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69914.778662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69919.986143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69925.303612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":69929.643868,"samples":28588,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":880},{"kind":"input","t":78312.490669,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79521.172512,"text":"Barselona'nın resmi dilleri Katalanca ve İspanyolca'dır. Yaklaşık yarısı Katalanca konuşmayı tercih ediyor, büyük bir çoğunluk bunu anlıyor ve neredeyse herkes İspanyolca biliyor."},{"kind":"audio","t":79622.30809800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79623.449689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":79624.189836,"samples":23071,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":79695.176676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79700.325498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79705.160826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79710.336007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79715.49188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79717.858569,"samples":16996,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":83795.25114400001,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84792.25565600001,"text":"Bazı bölgelerde suyu bir dakika kaynatmak yeterlidir, diğerlerinde ise birkaç dakika gereklidir."},{"kind":"audio","t":84904.368944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84909.31317000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84914.647879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84919.944359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84921.182258,"samples":11869,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":89855.23044700001,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90881.50598,"text":"Bitkiler en iyi doğal ortamlarında görünürler, bu yüzden tek bir sapı bile koparma isteğine karşı koyun."},{"kind":"audio","t":90992.210683,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90996.995031,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91002.27953100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91007.54608100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91009.88274100001,"samples":17721,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":97273.67979000001,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98307.987296,"text":"1920'lerde, çoğu vatandaşın ve ulusun hakim tutumu pasifizm ve izolasyondu."},{"kind":"audio","t":98420.3607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98425.402894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98430.688914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98435.954134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98436.712851,"samples":8804,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":103529.386466,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104694.167998,"text":"Masa Serif zamanının en üst yırtıcısıydı, bu yüzden diğer Mosullar dışında hiçbir şeyden korkmazdı."},{"kind":"audio","t":104807.144262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104808.45245900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104809.90301400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104811.536047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104812.58356900001,"samples":24408,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":113138.876674,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114447.995045,"text":"1537'de Asuncion'un kuruluşundan beri Paraguay, yerli karakterinin ve kimliğinin büyük bir kısmını korumayı başarmıştır."},{"kind":"audio","t":114591.509558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114596.766038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114601.93950000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114607.103252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114612.255794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114616.988643,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":119860.851041,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120821.133329,"text":"Hastalık domuzlar tarafından taşınmakta, ardından sivrisinekler aracılığıyla insanlara geçmektedir."},{"kind":"audio","t":120935.097416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120936.969644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120938.151234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120939.74935700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120940.72555,"samples":24687,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":129359.652986,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130281.050437,"text":"Modern araştırma teleskoplarının çoğu, uygun atmosferik koşullara sahip uzak bölgelerde bulunan devasa tesislerdir."},{"kind":"audio","t":130408.953266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130414.29738500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130419.54967500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130424.85253500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130430.250863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130431.24064599999,"samples":9752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":135223.344596,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136137.096557,"text":"İnsanlar, sabır ve anlayışın gezginler için de gerekli olduğunu öngörmeyebilirler."},{"kind":"audio","t":136232.240065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136237.21312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136242.425251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136245.490729,"samples":21232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":140539.37831200002,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141311.865752,"text":"Bu nedenle, notasyonun sadece bir etiket olarak eklenmiş olması muhtemeldir."},{"kind":"audio","t":141405.169072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141410.211196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141415.688132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141418.929527,"samples":22346,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":147770.724965,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148469.529411,"text":"Ancak kuşlarla ilgili hâlâ dinozora benzeyen pek çok şey var."},{"kind":"audio","t":148545.095613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148546.741045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148547.72064800002,"samples":30594,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":154956.011233,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":156247.135461,"text":"Hemen hemen hepsinin güvenli yüzme imkânı sunan kumsallar olduğu ve çoğunda ... tarafından sağlanan gölgeliklerin bulunduğu görülmektedir."},{"kind":"audio","t":156344.44068200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156349.82026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156355.224668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156355.912336,"samples":7857,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"audio","t":156361.810306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156367.125665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156370.313941,"samples":21120,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":157898.38714900002,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158220.479837,"text":"Pohican ağaçları."},{"kind":"audio","t":158256.029721,"samples":32322,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":164685.134521,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165810.993326,"text":"Evli ve iki yetişkin çocuk babası olan Duvall, hikayenin anlatıldığı Miller üzerinde büyük bir izlenim bırakmadı."},{"kind":"audio","t":165940.816843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165945.72646900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165951.020089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165956.298929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165961.243565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165961.710917,"samples":8080,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"close","t":176005.416402,"code":1005}]}